  "details": "I had an idea for a tab similar to the recently visted tab for worlds but instead for Instances themselves. This idea came to me because sometimes when VRChat crashes on me and I get back in, I don't remember which instances I've been to already or had just crashed from to get back to it and sometimes the instance just isn't on the list anymore but will be on the list for other people. A last visited timer of sorts would also help if you're Instance hopping in the same world but don't remember the instance number.",
